paragraph start
name: paragraph-a-chapter-holds
A chapter holds its own title, text and chapters. A comment
wraps one or more blocks and is dropped by the reader. An answer
sits inside the block it judges. Contract rows are copied from
files and are read only. Rows and headers belong inside a table.
