paragraph start
name: paragraph-rust-and-racket
Rust and Racket register the same list. A todo marks the box of
its block with TODO or DONE in the corner; a todo value that
starts with neither word counts as open. Opening a page in the
editor adds the names that are missing. Style and color apply to
the text of the block they sit on.
