paragraph start
name: paragraph-opening-a-page
Opening a page in the editor, or running the fill command, adds
an empty answer slot under every question that has none. It
never touches an answer already written. The view command with
the contracts flag draws each rule and question under its block
and counts them as ok, broken, open or unchecked.
