paragraph end

paragraph start
name: paragraph-every-other-block
Every other block gets a number too. Before the arrow stands the
chapter number. After it stands the full chain of blocks down to
that block, joined with dots, at any depth. A page with no
chapter has no arrow. Copy a block to another place and its
number follows its new place.
