paragraph start
name: paragraph-the-edition-command
The edition command prints the page as pages: a header with the
file name, a footer reading page N of M, and page numbers p.N
beside contents and index entries. Pages break at a fixed line
count, so a box can split across pages. It is a terminal
preview; PDF export comes last.
