code start
name: code-notation-render-file
language: text
notation render FILE  |  plain text render
notation render-rich FILE  |  unicode render
notation roundtrip FILE  |  prove the print back is identical
notation todos FILE  |  list every todo with its line
notation edition FILE  |  pages; flags --width W --lines L
notation index FOLDER  |  build .notation/index.db for the folder
aiutd FILE  |  open in the editor, needs a real tty
aiutd update  |  compile, tests at a level, docs
aiutd test --level N  |  run tests; --only NAME for one
aiutd record NAME KEYS  |  record a test from a real run
aiutd record-module NAME PATH EXPR  |  record a module test
aiutd docs  |  write the tutorial from the notation files
